    <string name="model_add_url">Add model from link</string>
    <string name="model_instructions">Use your own small model (GGUF):\n\n• From file: pick any .gguf on your phone — it is copied into private app storage.\n• From link: paste a direct .gguf download URL (e.g. from huggingface.co — open a model page, find the GGUF file list, copy the Q4_K_M file link).\n\nRecommended for this phone: Qwen3 0.6B or SmolLM2 360M (fast), Qwen2.5 0.5B / TinyLlama 1.1B (balanced), Llama 3.2 1B / Gemma 3 1B (smarter, slower), Phi-3.5 mini (smartest, heavy — plug in). Q4_K_M files give the best speed/quality balance. Chat format is auto-detected from the file name.\n\nModel files never leave this device and generation is fully offline.</string>
